      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 443972556,
          "type": null,
          "body": "In my profile, parse_enterprises_file() took 14.23% of the time to start tshark and dissect a short capture file.  This change would completely get rid of this!\n\nOne question then would be - does anyone maintain local entries in enterprises.tsv?  They could always edit the generated value_string_ext if they do their own build..\n\nAlso, I don't know perl.",
