        {
          "id": 444104049,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Just testing...\n```\ndiff --git a/tools/make-sminmpec.pl b/tools/make-sminmpec.pl\nindex 3d4856fac8..3ffa4926a1 100755\n--- a/tools/make-sminmpec.pl\n+++ b/tools/make-sminmpec.pl\n@@ -67,7 +67,7 @@ for(@in_lines) {\n                next if (/^\\s*\\(?\\s*unassigned/i);\n                $name =~ s/\\s+$//;\n                $name =~ s/ \\((formerly .*)\\)/\\t# $1/;\n-               $body .= \"\\n$code\\t$name\";\n+               $body .= \"\\t{$code,\\t\\\"$name\\\" },\\n\";\n        } elsif (/\\(last updated/i) {\n                $last_updated = $_;\n        } elsif (/^ *End of Document/) {\n@@ -88,7 +88,13 @@ print OUT <<\"_SMINMPEC\";\n # Where SPACE can be any sequence of spaces and tabs.\n #\n # $last_updated\n+\n+const value_string enterprises_vals[] = {\n $body\n+\\t{ 0, NULL }\n+};\n+\n+value_string_ext enterprises_vals_ext = VALUE_STRING_EXT_INIT(enterprises_vals);\n _SMINMPEC\n\n close OUT;\n\n```",
          "author": {
